From 7b1c29a94939a2d31f9b93311bb1734f99ee35af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 22:49:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(exam): figures for very large PDFs (local
 page-by-page read, smart page-image selection)

- Large PDFs (>10MB, up to 400MB / 2500 pages) are read locally via pdf.js range loading
- Analysis: per-page text snippets, or page thumbnails for scanned books
- Generation: full text of selected pages + images of figure-bearing pages (scored by raster/vector ops), 11MB budget
- Server accepts page images and rejects figure refs to pages that were not sent
